erent  types of music and different  demographics  and genres within those 90 minutes  and talk about the atmosphere of the  stage or  the shoulder uh obviously because you  used to get previous plays that are  the design that the the lighting going  to be  ambient mood swing or energetic i was  talking to the  caesar's personnel last night and they  said when you really get it right down  to it  harrah's is our newest property and i  said what do you mean because it's an  older hotel it's just no wait till you  walk through this and i walked through  it last night  they have redone everything they  finished all the rooms redid all the  rooms as of january  the showroom is going to be redesigned  and and updated the technology is going  to be completely different  the sound will absolutely blow you away  the visuals  uh the plans that that we have for this  show  i can hardly wait to present it on stage  yes it's going to be  you know a lot of work to get to that  point but when i hit that stage  with all this technology and all these  this  this professional touches that are going  to go into the show  i can hardly wait to present this show  to the public  uh will you be interacting with fans a  lot more with this  type of style i've got some ideas on how  to interact with my  with my fans who i must say  they are the most loyal fans anybody  could ever have  i've have fans that have been following  me since i was five years old  and uh they're still with me and then of  course new ones as well  who just discovered me you know just  recently  but through social media and you know  you got your pros and cons of social  media i  i actually like it because i can stay in  touch with  with my followers and i listen to him  all the time what do you want to hear  what do you want to do this and this  this and this  i do facebook live and and i stay in  touch with these people  because i remember it's important to me  because i remember a conversation i had  with  elvis pr